+
+static const char page[] =
+ "<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><title>VB235v Recovery</title>"
+ "<style>body{font:17px system-ui;max-width:58em;margin:2em auto;padding:1em}"
+ "button,input{font:inherit;margin:.4em}pre{white-space:pre-wrap}a{margin:.5em}</style>"
+ "<h1>VB235v 恢复控制台</h1><pre id=status>正在读取设备状态</pre>"
+ "<h2>备份</h2><p>校准备份请同时保存 ART 和 misc。完整物理镜像包含 main+OOB。</p>"
